{#
	A section registered in ACF with no Twig partial behind it.

	Visitors see nothing. Editors and admins see exactly what is missing and
	where to put it — a silent blank gap is how these go unnoticed for weeks.
#}

{% if current_user_can('edit_posts') %}
	<div class="missing-section" role="note">
		<p class="missing-section__title">חסרה תבנית לסקשן</p>
		<p class="missing-section__body">
			הסקשן <code>{{ layout }}</code> רשום ב־ACF אבל אין לו קובץ Twig.
			צרו את <code>templates/partials/sections/{{ layout|replace({'_': '-'}) }}.twig</code>,
			והוסיפו בלוק תואם ב־<code>assets/scss/_blocks.scss</code>.
		</p>
	</div>
{% endif %}
